0_(1D) Chantarelles. These basidiomycetes resemble classic mushrooms, with a cap that may be deeply depressed in the centre giving a funnel-like shape. Spores are borne on the outisde/underside of the funnel, which may be smooth or have broad gill-like ridges. 0716158831620Chantarelles.0
0a _(1D) Fruiting body yellow-orange-red, at least on the gills071615983163072
