0_(1E) Polypores _(Mushroom-like and bracket fungi) – tough or woody _(unlike boletes) on dead or dying trees _(although these may be underground), often perennial and some species can be very large; spore bearing surface with pores. Some polypores grow on soil or duff. 0857187971910Polypores0
