0_(128c) Earth Tongues _(Ascomycetes, Helotiales) These resemble their common name, usually a flattened fruiting body, sometimes without a distinct stalk. This order and similar looking species are discussed in A356-66; Ar865-78; M341-5; H 01453053501573540Earth Tongues0
