0b _(161a) Fruiting body 3-6cm tall, temperate 01623963991744030Dictyophora duplicata0
0a _(161b) Fruiting body a single stalk with dark green slimy spores at tip, no distinct ‘head’ 01633974001754040Mutinus caninus0
